# AGENTS.md — written into this working tree by an unrelated third-party tool
# (Pane, runpane.com), not by this project. Deliberately never committed: it is
# read as instructions by every agent tool that opens the repo, and its
# vocabulary collides head-on with ours — it means something different by
# "pane", "panel" and "tab" than `ctl panes` does. Keeping it untracked keeps
# the two products from being confused with each other.
AGENTS.md
